{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06086","headline":"过卢四员外宅看饭僧共题七韵 · 王维","name":"过卢四员外宅看饭僧共题七韵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三贤异七贤，青眼慕青莲。\n乞饭从香积，裁衣学水田。\n上人飞锡杖，檀越施金钱。\n趺作檐前日，焚香竹下烟。\n寒空法云地，秋色净居天。\n身逐因缘法，心过次第禅。\n不须愁日暮，自有一灯然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06086.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06086","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}